  (1) For the following input of shape `[1, 2, 2, 1]`, `block_shape = [2, 2]`, and
      `paddings = [[0, 0], [0, 0]]`:

  ```
  x = [[[[1], [2]], [[3], [4]]]]
  ```

  The output tensor has shape `[4, 1, 1, 1]` and value:

  ```
  [[[[1]]], [[[2]]], [[[3]]], [[[4]]]]
