     input according to `paddings` to produce `padded` of shape `padded_shape`.

  2. Reshape `padded` to `reshaped_padded` of shape:

       [batch] +
       [padded_shape[1] / block_shape[0],
         block_shape[0],
        ...,
        padded_shape[M] / block_shape[M-1],
        block_shape[M-1]] +
       remaining_shape

